<BLCMM v="1">
#<!!!You opened a file saved with BLCMM in FilterTool. Please update to BLCMM to properly open this file!!!>
	<head>
		<type name="BL2" offline="false"/>
		<profiles>
			<profile name="default" current="true"/>
		</profiles>
	</head>
	<body>
		<category name="Radiance">
			<comment>@title BL2 Radiance Mod</comment>
			<comment>@main-author RadiantArin</comment>
			<comment>@version 1.0.0</comment>
			<comment>@description A large overhaul mod meant to make the game more dynamic. Visit the Github for more details.</comment>
			<comment>-</comment>
			<comment>Created by RadiantArin</comment>
			<comment></comment>
			<comment>Credits for helping make the Mod: ZetaDaemon for multiple fixes,</comment>
			<comment>Apocalyptech, Osetor, ShadowEvil, Juso for the FiringPattern mod,</comment>
			<comment></comment>
			<comment>This is a large overhaul mod pack meant to make the game more dynamic.</comment>
			<comment>Gun parts now largely affect guns more, so an AR with Vladof parts will have</comment>
			<comment>very fast reload and Fire Rate, much more than its predecessors. No more "matching grip" or "matching barrel".</comment>
			<comment></comment>
			<comment>This also changes game balance, nerfs and buffs some guns, and changes enemies</comment>
			<comment>and raid bosses to be more 1P friendly.</comment>
			<comment></comment>
			<comment>This mod also has customizable features for farming and UVHM rebalancing, enabling</comment>
			<comment>you to play the game how you want to!</comment>
			<comment></comment>
			<comment>All Vault Hunters have new skills and there are new guns and items as well.</comment>
			<comment></comment>
			<comment>DEVELOPER NOTICE!!! DO NOT run this mod with other overhaul mods. Some examples may include BL2Fix, BL2: Exodus, BL2.5, BL2: Reborn, and many others.</comment>
			<comment>The mod creator, Arin, is not responsible for any bugs or glitches that result of opening and running multiple mods at once.</comment>
			<comment>Before reporting a bug, please test extensively to make sure it is within the confines of the Radiance mod, and not a mishap between two mods.</comment>
			<comment></comment>
			<comment>Requires Command Extensions, Sanity Saver, and thus also the PythonSDK to function properly</comment>
			<category name="Requirements" locked="true">
				<comment>CE_EnableOn Force</comment>
				<comment>suppress_next_chat "Error: This mod requires Command Extensions. A lot of things will not work properly without it."</comment>
				<comment>say Error: This mod requires Command Extensions. A lot of things will not work properly without it.</comment>
				<comment>py if not hasattr(Mods, "SanitySaver"): unrealsdk.GetEngine().GamePlayers[0].Actor.GetTextChatMovie().AddChatMessageInternal("[Radiance]", "Warning: this mod requires SanitySaver. Items will not save properly without it.")</comment>
				<comment>say Running Radiance V. 1.00!</comment>
			</category>
			<category name="Universal Settings" locked="true">
				<category name="Starting Ammo">
					<code profiles="default">set D_Resourcepools.AmmoPools.Ammo_Combat_Rifle_Pool BaseMaxValue (BaseValueConstant=360.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set D_Resourcepools.AmmoPools.Ammo_Rocket_Launcher_Pool BaseMaxValue (BaseValueConstant=15.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set D_Resourcepools.AmmoPools.Ammo_Repeater_Pistol_Pool BaseMaxValue (BaseValueConstant=250.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set D_Resourcepools.AmmoPools.Ammo_Combat_Shotgun_Pool BaseMaxValue (BaseValueConstant=100.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set D_Resourcepools.AmmoPools.Ammo_Patrol_SMG_Pool BaseMaxValue (BaseValueConstant=420.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set D_Resourcepools.AmmoPools.Ammo_Sniper_Rifle_Pool BaseMaxValue (BaseValueConstant=56.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
				</category>
				<category name="Remove Level Variance">
					<hotfix name="Hotfix" level="None">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance.RandomNumbers.Random_Minus01-Plus01 RandomVariance (bEnabled=True,bUseIntegerRandomization=True,LowerBound=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),UpperBound=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000))</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance.RandomNumbers.Random_Minus02-Plus01 RandomVariance (bEnabled=True,bUseIntegerRandomization=True,LowerBound=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),UpperBound=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000))</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Economy.VendingMachine.Init_VendingMachine_LootGamestageVariance RandomVariance (bEnabled=True,bUseIntegerRandomization=True,LowerBound=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),UpperBound=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000))</code>
					</hotfix>
				</category>
				<category name="Auto Pickup">
					<comment>Pretty self explanatory.</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Currency.A_Item.EridiumStick bAutomaticallyPickup True</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Currency.A_Item.EridiumBar bAutomaticallyPickup True</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Iris_TorgueToken.UsableItems.Pickup_TorgueToken bAutomaticallyPickup True</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Orchid_SeraphCrystal.UsableItems.Pickup_SeraphCrystal bAutomaticallyPickup True</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Iris_SeraphCrystal.UsableItems.Pickup_SeraphCrystal bAutomaticallyPickup True</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Sage_SeraphCrystal.UsableItems.Pickup_SeraphCrystal bAutomaticallyPickup True</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Aster_SeraphCrystal.UsableItems.Pickup_SeraphCrystal bAutomaticallyPickup True</code>
				</category>
				<category name="Universal Balance Scalar">
					<comment>Decreased from 1.13 to 1.10.</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_UniversalBalanceScaler:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 1.10</code>
				</category>
				<category name="FFYL">
					<comment>You now revive with full shield and partially more health than vanilla. Also you move faster.</comment>
					<hotfix name="Hotfix" level="None">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_PlayerShared.injured.PlayerInjuredDefinition RevivedHealthPctOfMax 0.350000</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_PlayerShared.injured.PlayerInjuredDefinition RevivedShieldPctOfMax 1.000000</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_PlayerShared.injured.PlayerInjuredDefinition InjuredMovementSpeed 300.00</code>
					</hotfix>
				</category>
				<category name="Weapon Elemental Parts">
					<comment>Changing to -10% damage instead of -20%.</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_AssaultRifle.elemental.AR_Elemental_Corrosive WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_AssaultRifle.elemental.AR_Elemental_Fire WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_AssaultRifle.elemental.AR_Elemental_Shock WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_AssaultRifle.elemental.AR_Elemental_Slag WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Launchers.elemental.RL_Elemental_Corrosive WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Launchers.elemental.RL_Elemental_Fire WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Launchers.elemental.RL_Elemental_Shock WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Launchers.elemental.RL_Elemental_Slag WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.elemental.Pistol_Elemental_Corrosive WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.elemental.Pistol_Elemental_Fire WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.elemental.Pistol_Elemental_Shock WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.elemental.Pistol_Elemental_Slag WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_SMG.elemental.SMG_Elemental_Corrosive WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_SMG.elemental.SMG_Elemental_Fire WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_SMG.elemental.SMG_Elemental_Shock WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_SMG.elemental.SMG_Elemental_Slag WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Shotgun.elemental.Shotgun_Elemental_Corrosive WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Shotgun.elemental.Shotgun_Elemental_Fire WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Shotgun.elemental.Shotgun_Elemental_Shock WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Shotgun.elemental.Shotgun_Elemental_Slag WeaponAttributeEffects ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage',ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.100000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))</code>
				</category>
				<category name="Elemental Damage">
					<comment>Element Matching has more of an effect. Subsequent playthroughs increase by 25/50/75%.</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_NormalElementResistMultiplier_ByPlaythrough ConditionalInitialization (bEnabled=True,ConditionalExpressionList=((BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_LessThanOrEqual,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=1.000000))),(BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_EqualTo,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=2.000000)))),DefaultBaseValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_HighElementResistMultiplier_ByPlaythrough ConditionalInitialization (bEnabled=True,ConditionalExpressionList=((BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=0.750000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_LessThanOrEqual,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=1.000000))),(BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=0.500000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_EqualTo,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=2.000000)))),DefaultBaseValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_CorrosiveBonusDamageMultiplier_ByPlaythrough ConditionalInitialization (bEnabled=True,ConditionalExpressionList=((BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=1.250000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_EqualTo,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=1.000000))),(BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=1.500000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_EqualTo,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=2.000000)))),DefaultBaseValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_FireBonusDamageMultiplier_ByPlaythrough ConditionalInitialization (bEnabled=True,ConditionalExpressionList=((BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=1.250000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_EqualTo,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=1.000000))),(BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=1.500000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_EqualTo,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=2.000000)))),DefaultBaseValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_ShockBonusDamageMultiplier_ByPlaythrough ConditionalInitialization (bEnabled=True,ConditionalExpressionList=((BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=1.250000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_EqualTo,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=1.000000))),(BaseValueIfTrue=(BaseValueConstant=1.500000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Expressions=((AttributeOperand1=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Balance.PlayThroughCount',ComparisonOperator=OPERATOR_EqualTo,Operand2Usage=OPERAND_PreferAttribute,AttributeOperand2=None,ConstantOperand2=2.000000)))),DefaultBaseValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000))</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Impact.DamageType.DmgType_Normal FleshDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Impact.DamageType.DmgType_Normal ArmorDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.750000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Impact.DamageType.DmgType_Normal ShieldDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Explosive.DamageType.DmgType_Explosive_Impact FleshDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Explosive.DamageType.DmgType_Explosive_Impact ArmorDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.750000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Explosive.DamageType.DmgType_Explosive_Impact ShieldDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Incendiary.DamageType.DmgType_Incendiary_Impact FleshDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=1.250000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_FireBonusDamageMultiplier_ByPlaythrough',BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Incendiary.DamageType.DmgType_Incendiary_Impact ArmorDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.750000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_HighElementResistMultiplier_ByPlaythrough',BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Incendiary.DamageType.DmgType_Incendiary_Impact ShieldDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.750000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_HighElementResistMultiplier_ByPlaythrough',BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Corrosive.DamageType.DmgType_Corrosive_Impact FleshDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Corrosive.DamageType.DmgType_Corrosive_Impact ArmorDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=1.250000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_CorrosiveBonusDamageMultiplier_ByPlaythrough',BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Corrosive.DamageType.DmgType_Corrosive_Impact ShieldDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.750000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_CorrosiveMediumResistMultiplier_ByPlaythrough',BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Shock.DamageType.DmgType_Shock_Impact FleshDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.750000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_HighElementResistMultiplier_ByPlaythrough',BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Shock.DamageType.DmgType_Shock_Impact ArmorDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.750000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_HighElementResistMultiplier_ByPlaythrough',BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Shock.DamageType.DmgType_Shock_Impact ShieldDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=1.250000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.DamageMultipliers.Init_ShockBonusDamageMultiplier_ByPlaythrough',BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Amp.DamageType.DmgType_Amp_Impact FleshDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.900000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Amp.DamageType.DmgType_Amp_Impact ArmorDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.900000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Amp.DamageType.DmgType_Amp_Impact ShieldDamageModifier (BaseValueConstant=0.900000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
				</category>
				<category name="Slag Changes">
					<comment>Nerfed Slag to 25% damage instead of 100%.</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Amp.Skills.Skill_AmplifyDamage SkillEffectDefinitions ((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.DamageSourceModifiers.ReceivedAmplifyDamageModifier',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.250000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),BonusUpgradeList=),(AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.DamageTypeModifers.AmpImpactDamageModifier',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),BonusUpgradeList=))</code>
				</category>
				<comment>Dedicated Boss Drop Chance can be changed here.</comment>
				<comment>--</comment>
				<comment>VANILLA: Regular 10% drop chance.</comment>
				<comment>ENHANCED: 30% drop chance.</comment>
				<comment>SHOWER ME IN LOOT!: Guaranteed.</comment>
				<category name="Dedicated Boss Drop Chance" MUT="true" locked="true">
					<category name="Vanilla">
						<code profiles="">set GD_Itempools.DropWeights.DropODDS_BossUniques:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 0.100000</code>
					</category>
					<category name="Enhanced">
						<code profiles="">set GD_Itempools.DropWeights.DropODDS_BossUniques:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 0.300000</code>
					</category>
					<category name="Shower Me In Loot!">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Itempools.DropWeights.DropODDS_BossUniques:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 1.000000</code>
					</category>
				</category>
				<category name="Vendors Contain More Items">
					<comment>Increases the quantity of items in vendors.</comment>
					<hotfix name="Hotfix" level="None">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_ItemPools_Shop.Items.Shoppool_Weapons_FlatChance Quantity (BaseValueConstant=12.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_ItemPools_Shop.HealthShop.HealthShop_Items Quantity (BaseValueConstant=12.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_ItemPools_Shop.AmmoShop.VendingMachinePool_GrenadeMods Quantity (BaseValueConstant=12.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
					</hotfix>
				</category>
				<category name="Eridium Chest">
					<comment>By Hemaxhu</comment>
					<comment>Allows you to open the Golden Chest in Sanctuary for 25 Eridium.</comment>
					<category name="Code">
						<hotfix name="Hotfix" level="None">
							<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_Treasure.InteractiveObjects.InteractiveObj_TreasureChest_Golden:BehaviorProviderDefinition_1.Behavior_SetUsabilityCost_10 CostCurrencyType CURRENCY_Eridium</code>
							<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_Treasure.InteractiveObjects.InteractiveObj_TreasureChest_Golden:BehaviorProviderDefinition_1.Behavior_SetUsabilityCost_10 CostAmount 25</code>
						</hotfix>
					</category>
				</category>
			</category>
			<category name="Enemy Scaling" locked="true">
				<category name="Enemy Global Changes">
					<comment>Decreased enemy damage per level. Increased enemy health per level.</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_BaseEnemyHealth:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 50.000000</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_UniversalAdditionalEnemyDamagePerLvl:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 0.000000</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_UniversalAdditionalEnemyHealthPerLvl:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 0.030000</code>
				</category>
				<comment>UVHM Rebalance can be toggled on and off here.</comment>
				<comment>EASY: Enemy stats reduced by 25%. Damage they deal is also decreased by 25%.</comment>
				<comment>NORMAL: Normal stats. No changes to damage or health.</comment>
				<comment>HARD: Enemy stats increased by 25%. Damage they deal is also increased by 50%.</comment>
				<comment>HURT ME MORE: Enemy stats increased by 50%. Damage they deal is also increased by 100%. Adds back the vanilla health regen.</comment>
